budget-variant hardening this PR itself ships: the class doc in
`resumed_context_cache.dart` correctly says "keyed by (path, sizeBytes,
mtimeMs, variant)", and `match()`/`remember()` take `variant`. A reader of
this field comment would miss that two different resume budgets legitimately
miss each other's entries (the exact bug the variant prevents).

